WEBVTT

43:31.677 --> 43:34.263
What is it, sweet lady?

43:35.931 --> 43:38.184
Does the hound frighten you?

43:38.309 --> 43:39.768
Away with you, dog.

43:40.603 --> 43:42.313
You're scaring my lady.

43:44.648 --> 43:46.650
I don't like to see you upset.

43:49.278 --> 43:51.071
The sun's finally shining.

43:51.906 --> 43:53.741
Come walk with me.

43:54.867 --> 43:56.869
Stay, Lady.
